        "original_id": "5765eceb-6942-5648-9ae2-bde661356bfd",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ronnie Simpson\n- Organizations: Celtic F.C.\n- Places: Glasgow, Scotland\n- Events: European Cup, Lisbon Lions\n- Topics: Scottish football\n\nFacts:\n- Celtic F.C. was founded in 1887 to help alleviate poverty among the immigrant Irish population in Glasgow's East End.\n- Celtic F.C. is a professional football club based in Glasgow, Scotland, and it plays in the Scottish Premiership.\n- Ronnie Simpson is mainly remembered for his time with Celtic F.C.\n- Ronnie Simpson was a member of Celtic F.C.'s \"Lisbon Lions\" team that won the European Cup in 1967.",
